{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_11_level_main_11-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_11",
  "stageId": "main_11-05",
  "title": "演绎文明",
  "storyCode": "11-6",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ec4fb90598c46845aa49d0d1e34b5c803004832e7687157156282d908b8c311c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你来这里做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像我说的那样，只是来看一场演出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......孩子们，都到我身后来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莱托中校，无意冒犯，但这里不欢迎你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们不用这么生分吧，戈尔丁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一向认同你的努力，越是艰难的时代，教育的重要性就越应该被凸显出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中校先生，您这么说，好像自己和这个“艰难的时代”没什么关系似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不管什么时代，您穿得可总是十足体面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您胸前的勋章也越来越多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "协助军事委员会管理伦蒂尼姆不是一件轻松的事情，我也遇到了很多......困难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我对这座城市的热爱始终未曾改变，就这点而言，我和你们一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鞋匠汤姆肯定很赞同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "汤姆也是我的朋友，发生那样的事我并不乐意见到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他只是喝醉了酒，嘟囔“陛下”和“蒸汽骑士”什么的，他甚至不怎么会拼“萨卡兹”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他还活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们存在的意义不只是活着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你想指控我为维多利亚的叛徒吗，戈尔丁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "女士们，我敬佩你们的勇气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过你们误会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我今天来这里，只是想再看一看这所学校罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "茉莉小姐，很遗憾，看来你已经忘记我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......忘记？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在这里度过的时间不比你少，茉莉小姐。我甚至还记得你和同你一起来的那批孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很遗憾，军校毕业后，我的空闲时间就没有那么多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可戈尔丁，你曾是信任我的。我们时常一起谈论高卢的历史，聊起那些不朽的文学——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "够了，莱托中校。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我十分感谢你的父亲，他多年来一直资助着这所学校，他试图为孩子们点燃智慧的火炬，驱散蒙昧与混沌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾以为你是和他一样的人......而你，却亲手熄灭了那点本就微弱的火光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是吗？戈尔丁，那你觉得，这所学校为什么能维持到今天？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——你别想威胁我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我并没有威胁各位的理由和动机，孩子们还在呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "戈尔丁女士，我们都是高卢遗民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们都知道，战争是最无情的毁灭者，除了带走成千上万的生命，还会摧毁人类为通向智识做出的一切努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不想看见伦蒂尼姆变成下一个林贡斯，也不想让刚才看到的如此美好的戏剧演出就此绝迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是我为我自己选择的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我无法赞同你的看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "林贡斯的皇家歌剧院已经化作灰烬，而《凯旋颂》仍在各时各地被反复演绎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "建筑会倒塌，巨构会瓦解，但我们曾凝集其中的结晶却永不会消亡。那是我们的教育、我们的文化、我们的希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "战争的阴云越是浓烈，我们就越是需要坚持信念，需要相信美的东西，来提醒自己身为人类与野兽的差别。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你相信这种对抗能赢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们所代表的那些东西，恐惧、权力、杀戮......永远无法驯化每一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我必须相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我只能相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只要有光，我们就会向光而行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我羡慕你，戈尔丁女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看头顶的阴云吧，暴风雨就快来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在落雷之前，我们都还有时间，我们都还有选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "希望有一天......我能看到这出戏的结尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "离开学校之后，城防军指挥官并未在街上停留。\n他的确是一个人来的，并没有更多城防军官兵来到附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她必须找到亚当斯，将消息传出去。\n不管那位指挥官表现得多么没有敌意，他都不会无缘无故地找上他们学校。\n茉莉不知道，孩子们不知道，可是戈尔丁知道他为什么会来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么突然这么多萨卡兹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "通往书店的路很熟悉，她在过去两年多的时间里走了无数回。\n可今天这条路突然变得很长，长到一眼望不到头，她又想到了萨卡兹进城的那一天。\n她真的能够改变吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我必须相信，我必须......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "戈尔丁突然感觉到自己被一种恐惧扼住了咽喉。\n她简直要吐出来了，她转身逃离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兰西，帕蒂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这些孩子......！兰——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......或许这样简单的任务并不值得劳您大驾，阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那样的话，你应该选择把戈尔丁女士抓起来，莱托。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "曼弗雷德就会这么做。换作老红眼病的话，整座学校都不会剩下一个活口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_426_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，我们知道你不是萨卡兹。你还想着给自己，给城防军，给这座城市里的居民留一点最后的体面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "变形者集群",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我们相信这样会更保险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "兰西，帕蒂......不知道孩子们有没有危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "中校先生，我很害怕。我既害怕像您这样的人和萨卡兹伤害孩子们，也害怕......孩子们变成像您一样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您的语气和这位昏迷的女士一模一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......我们在感受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她关心那些年幼的维多利亚人，胜过关心自己。我们能感受到，却很难理解。尤其这种关心还不是基于血缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......阁下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们对你们很感兴趣。透过你们，我们能更好地理解自己......理解萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您想从我们身上找寻一些答案？关于......什么的答案？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "莱托，你并不像那种对萨卡兹感到好奇的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "任务是第一优先的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "把这位茉莉小姐带回去吧，中校先生。看好她。我们会留在戈尔丁女士身边，为接下来的战争取得更多情报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是，阁下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了，阁下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人发现我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莱托中校",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_649_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是否需要我让更多士兵过来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不必了，士兵们拦不住他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他从特蕾西娅那里学到了不少。我们也许很快就能......轻松地聊聊天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......茉莉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我出去的这段时间，没出什么事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有，兰西和帕蒂吓坏了，拉尔夫那几个大孩子带着小家伙们休息去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就好。我在想......孩子们会喜欢这些戏的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的努力是有意义的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您不用在意那个城防军指挥官的话，戈尔丁女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我不是很舒服，我想休息一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#5$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，茉莉，这里就麻烦你收拾了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这出戏该有一个结尾的，蒸汽骑士已经走到王宫门前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "过几天，孩子们会把最后一幕演完的，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "戈尔丁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_647_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......一定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个故事的结尾只要没被演绎，就总是有很多种可能性的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是，已经上演的戏，也未必无法改变，人们总是想看到更新鲜的版本。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你在一旁看了很久了，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然舞台还在，我们能不能重新演一遍呢？从第一幕开始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所有人都总是在幻想，如果一切没有发生会怎样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_650_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "推演没有意义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但如果只是些渺茫的可能性......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "茉莉",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_657_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好先生，若您正好闲来无事，不如加入这场演出吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "早安，阁下！您的脸上布满愁容，请问是什么让您如此心焦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "胜利的号角声已在城墙上盘旋了三天三夜，可我的心为何还是如此焦灼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们伟大的将军不是早已凯旋了吗？赞美他的英勇与无畏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "英勇？无畏？也许是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一次激进的号召，将我们的信念凝成一团。代价，却是近在眼前的毁灭和仇恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你本该侍奉一位君主，却将你的忠诚献给了一位贼人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "舞台上，神秘的观众向前一步，视线从眼前人的身上移向了远方。\n他并非在酝酿情绪，相反，他在整理那些早已尘封的关于另一处战场的往事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我追随的并非君主，而是一种正直，一股勇气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "再往前走的话，迎接你的只有毁灭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "活着看到这个国家被暴君带着走向毁灭，远比个体毁灭更可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎知她的结局，阁下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我能预见她的结局，正如我知晓她的来路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "胡说！你尚年幼，怎敢张口怀念往昔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁能令太阳永不下落？生出这种欲望本就是最大的贪婪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为了维系这盛大的光辉，我见过无数疯狂之举。他们或是化身强盗，或是相互争斗，最终只会加速这个国家的腐朽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“茉莉”在舞台上转了个身，轻踱几步，再回过身，将面目隐藏在灯光下的阴影里。\n但另一位演员先开口了，他神色沉静如水，微微侧手，又将双手交叉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他们不愿承认，下坠之人想要攀住日光，握在手中的却只可能是闪电。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "难道人们就只能甘愿坠落？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人们也可以选择不再回望山巅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假使他们掉转自己的视线，他们会发现面前的深渊不是深渊，而是包含无穷可能性的沃土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“茉莉”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深渊可被战胜？你并不清楚深渊的真相，也未必知晓，时间紧迫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“神秘观众”",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "深渊就在身前，我等可用肉身填于深渊，用鲜血烧尽残垣，给后人留下一片广阔原野。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
